# Frontend

- Build the real usable screen first, not a marketing landing page unless requested.
- Avoid generic "AI slop" UI and overused defaults (Inter/Roboto, purple-on-white gradients, nested cards).
- Use distinctive but restrained typography, color, motion, and spacing.
- Use CSS variables for theme consistency.
- Icons for familiar actions; text buttons for clear commands.
- Verify desktop/mobile layout, text fit, and no overlap.

## JSX text
- Attributes: double quotes.
- JS/TS strings: single quotes unless the string contains `'`.
- Text with apostrophes/quotes: `<p>{"User's Profile"}</p>`.
